# Allow-list for the Linux test rig. Everything is excluded unless re-included below, so local
# secrets (.nuget-key), IDE state (.vs) and build output never enter the image.
*
!CodeMap.sln
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Packages.props
!global.json
!.editorconfig
!src
!tests
!testdata
# The concurrency harness clones the repo (git clone --local) — needs the object store.
!.git

**/bin
**/obj
**/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts
**/TestResults
